# No Conflicts with cups-browsed (issue #111): cups-daemon recommends it,
# so most Debian systems have it. Printer Picker skips its implicitclass://
# queues instead: they stop with "No destination host name supplied by
# cups-browsed" (seen on a Canon over Wi-Fi) unless it keeps running, and
# CUPS 2.4 sets up IPP Everywhere printers itself.
Suggests: zacos9-emulators,
          kdeconnect
Breaks: zacos9 (<< 1.18.32)
Replaces: zacos9 (<< 1.18.32)
Description: classic Platinum desktop for Wayland
 ZacOS 9 is a desktop in the style of a late-1990s Platinum
 interface: a wlroots compositor that draws Platinum window frames,
 a menu bar, a spatial Finder and control panels, with original fonts,
 icons, cursors, desktop patterns and sounds.
 .
 This package contains the desktop session. It installs a "ZacOS 9"
 session for login managers and the zacos9-session command for starting
 it from a text console.

Package: zacos9-greeter
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
