Breaks: zacos9 (<< 1.18.32)
Replaces: zacos9 (<< 1.18.32)
Description: ZacOS 9 login window for greetd
 The Platinum login window shown by greetd. It runs a zacos9-wm of its
 own, draws the ZacOS 9 login screen, and falls back to tuigreet when the
 graphical window cannot start.

Package: zacos9
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
