Recommends: balena-etcher
Description: ZacOS 9 desktop and system integration
 The full ZacOS 9 system: the desktop session, the greetd login window,
 the installer, Setup Assistant, Startup Disk, Software, Software Update,
 the boot splash and the GRUB integration.
 .
 Install zacos9-session instead on another distribution that supplies its
 own boot, installer and login manager.
